    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Water Lily Town Roaming Guide】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Anecdotes of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Welcome to Water Lily Town.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 64</>, head to {Location:[睡莲小镇(134,-14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0} and <Assistant_Red> read the notes </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Water Lily Town Roaming Guide】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Anecdotes of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Welcome to Water Lily Town.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 64</>, head to {Location:[Water Lily Town(134,-14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0} and <Assistant_Red> read the notes </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【非凡人物评分】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>评分说明：</>点击<Assistant_System>菜单-角色-非凡评分-非凡人物</>即可查看当前角色的非凡人物评分，非凡人物评分是角色<Assistant_Red>已装配</>的秘偶和人脉技能，以及秘偶属性和历史研究的养成评价\n<Assistant_Title2>提分指南：</>体验<Assistant_System>以战养战、世界冒险和教团玩法</>，获取<Assistant_Property1>金纺线</>和<Assistant_Property1>历史明灯</>，进行人脉和秘偶养成；提高自身的等级和序列，以提升自身的技能等级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Beyonder Character Rating】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Explanation: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Character - Beyonder Rating - Beyonder Character</> to view your current character's Beyonder Character Rating. This is an evaluation of your <Assistant_Red>equipped</> marionettes, Connection Skills, marionette attributes, and historical research.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rating Guide: </>Experience <Assistant_System>War-forged Growth, World Adventure, and Church gameplay</> to obtain <Assistant_Property1>Gold Thread</> and <Assistant_Property1>Historical Beacon</> to develop Connections and marionettes; increase your level and Sequence to raise your skill levels.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【高原战】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>高原战</>是势力战中的<Assistant_Red>800人</>战场。战场资格会在每轮四方联赛第一场结束后<Assistant_Red>21:20</>分配，获得资格的俱乐部成员可在<Assistant_System>以战养战-势力-高原战</>界面查看赛程安排。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心目标：</>各势力需要争夺战场中央平台上的<Assistant_Property1>死亡骑士</>。死亡骑士会跟随身边<Assistant_Red>20米</>内非凡者数量最多的势力，且获得跟随至少需要<Assistant_Red>5人</>。死亡骑士身边的势力会定时增加势力积分，获得死亡骑士跟随的势力加分更高。\n<Assistant_Title2>胜利规则：</>成功将死亡骑士送达本阵营广场，可额外获得<Assistant_Red>1200势力积分</>。达到<Assistant_Red>15000势力积分</>的势力会提前获胜；战斗结束时，会根据四皇势力积分排名发放不同档次奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>劣势机制：</>与第一名相差<Assistant_Red>3000势力积分</>的势力会被视为劣势势力。每<Assistant_Red>5分钟</>，劣势势力广场前会投放<Assistant_Property1>绊马索</>，只有本势力非凡者可以拾取，使用后可减速死亡骑士；每<Assistant_Red>8分钟</>，劣势势力广场会开启集合传送，需要<Assistant_Red>1名</>非凡者前往广场区域激活，成功后该势力所有非凡者可传送至广场区域并获得强力buff。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与方式：</>{JumpToUI:[前往高原战]|1250323}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Highland Battle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </><Assistant_System>Highland Battle</> is an <Assistant_Red>800-player</> battlefield in the Faction War. Eligibility is assigned at <Assistant_Red>21:20</> after the first match of each Four-Way League round. Eligible club members can view the schedule in the <Assistant_System>War-Driven Growth - Faction - Highland Battle</> interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective: </>Factions must compete for the <Assistant_Property1>Dead Knight</> on the central platform of the battlefield. The Dead Knight will follow the faction with the most Beyonders within <Assistant_Red>20 meters</>, and requires at least <Assistant_Red>5 people</> to follow. The faction near the Dead Knight gains faction points periodically, with the faction being followed gaining more points.\n<Assistant_Title2>Victory Rules: </>Successfully escorting the Dead Knight to your faction's plaza grants an additional <Assistant_Red>1200 faction points</>. The faction that reaches <Assistant_Red>15000 faction points</> wins early; at the end of the battle, rewards are distributed based on the faction point ranking.\n<Assistant_Title2>Disadvantage Mechanism: </>Factions trailing the first place by <Assistant_Red>3000 faction points</> are considered disadvantaged. Every <Assistant_Red>5 minutes</>, <Assistant_Property1>Tripwires</> will be dropped in front of the disadvantaged faction's plaza, which can only be picked up by their own Beyonders and used to slow down the Dead Knight; every <Assistant_Red>8 minutes</>, a group teleport will open at the disadvantaged faction's plaza, requiring <Assistant_Red>1</> Beyonder to go to the plaza area to activate it. Once successful, all Beyonders of that faction can teleport to the plaza area and gain a powerful buff.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>{JumpToUI:[Go to Highland Battle]|1250323}",
